# D44/D46/D47 resources and events, D52 contextual `the`, D56 declarative elements.
create the window into the app
title of app is "Sample"
create text box into nameBox
create primary button into helloButton
the text of helloButton is "Say Hello"
put nameBox, helloButton in app
when helloButton is clicked
    say the text of the nameBox
.
when app is closed
    say "bye"
.
show app

page "Dashboard"
    layout centered
    gap 16
    align center
    columns 2 on medium
    stack on small
    card "Welcome"
        layout stack
        spread
        round 12
        background "#123456"
        padding 20
        width full
        heading "Hello"
        text "Body"
        primary button "Go"
            hover
                grow 1.1
                animate 200ms ease-out
            click
                say "clicked"
        secondary button "Back"
            enter
                fade in
                move up 30
                animate 0.5 s spring
        danger button "Stop"
            leave
                slide from left
        input nameField
    grid 3
        layout grid 3
        panel
            text "a"
    section "Footer"
        link "Docs"
        image "logo.png"
    sidebar "Nav"
        text "x"
    main "Body"
        text "y"
